# Proposed third-party notices and inventory

This draft is not a grant of rights and is not a complete software bill of materials. The repository's first-party license is pending rights-holder approval. Do not redistribute the project or its artifacts on the basis of this file.

Before any public distribution, generate and review an inventory for:

- all direct and transitive JavaScript dependencies from `pnpm-lock.yaml`;
- all direct and transitive Go modules from `apps/print-agent/go.mod` and `go.sum`;
- fonts, images, icons, generated assets, and printer-driver dependencies;
- build and runtime container base images and their licenses;
- release artifacts and image layers.

Record package/module name, exact version, source, declared SPDX license or evidence, and any notice obligations. Treat missing, ambiguous, or unavailable license evidence as unverified and fail the public-release gate. The inventory script must not print secret values or unrelated source contents.
